      "path": "/summary",
      "value": "I am a finance professional with one year of experience in trade operations, specializing in U.S. market settlements. I possess proficiency in equity settlements, trade reconciliation, and inventory management, all of which contribute to the timely and accurate execution of trades. I possess expertise in managing unmatched trades, effectively communicating with counterparties and the middle office, and effectively addressing trade discrepancies. I have a wealth of experience in processing cash equities, stock settlements, and corporate actions, all while ensuring compliance with industry regulations. I possess a robust comprehension of the trade life cycle, the intricacies of the market, and the procedures involved in settlement. I excel in problem-solving, risk mitigation, and collaborating with onshore stakeholders, including middle office and risk teams. I am proficient in MS Excel, possessing strong analytical skills and a meticulous approach.",
